        "text": "Tip #3: \u201cI Told the Installer to Test\nMy Graphics, and They Failed\u201d\nThe installer may have guessed wrong about what hardware you have.\nDouble-check the settings as best you can. If they look right, try choosing a lower\nresolution for now and testing again, and if that fails try a lower number of colors\nand test again. You can then try setting things back the way you want them after\nthe machine is fully installed and updated, when it hopefully has a fix for what-\never the problem might be.",
